      "description": "Zinkraft™ embodies syncretic design — a seamless fusion of opposites that shouldn’t work, but absolutely do. Upright and italic, serif and sans, bold and offbeat, it’s a walking contradiction that somehow makes perfect sense. Made for logotypes and fearless design.\n\nA futuristic fashion brand? A title sequence for a dystopian indie game? A cover for a high-concept lifestyle magazine? From sports apparel to experimental art projects, from sci-fi menus to food packaging, Zinkraft feels equally at home in glossy fashion editorials and rebellious youth campaigns.\n\nThis versatile, stand-out, genre-bending display typeface comes in a wide array of weights and 4 optical sizes.",
